OL,3,GNEWSAChurch chimes return after
OL,4,Athousands sign petition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA church bell is chiming the time once
OL,7,Fmore, after thousands of people signed
OL,8,Fa petition against its silencing due to
OL,9,Fa single noise complaint
OL,11,FThe clock at St Margaret's in
OL,12,FWolstanton, Staffordshire, had chimed
OL,13,Fsince 1889 without issue, apart from
OL,14,Fduring the two world wars and periods
OL,15,Fof maintenance, the church said.
OL,17,FIn a post on social media, the church
OL,18,Fsaid the chimes were silenced from
OL,19,F18:00 GMT on Thursday after an officer
OL,20,Ffrom Newcastle-under-Lyme Borough
OL,21,FCouncil instructed it to do so while a
OL,22,Fcomplaint was investigated.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
